[[Image:Lion's Pride Inn.jpg|thumb|300px|Lion's Pride Inn]]
'''Lion's Pride Inn''' (also known as the '''Goldshire Inn''')<ref>[https://wowpedia.fandom.com/wiki/Journey_of_Brann Journey of Brann]</ref> is an [[inn]] found in the town of [[Goldshire]], in [[Elwynn Forest]]. According to [[Innkeeper Farley]], the inn's motto is "Rest and relaxation for the tired and cold."<ref>{{Alliance}} [5] [[Rest and Relaxation]]</ref>

Lion's Pride offers a wide range of services from class trainers and quest givers to drinks aplenty.

